```

`CollateralManager::lenderClaimCollateral`
```javascript
    function lenderClaimCollateral(uint256 _bidId) external onlyTellerV2 {
        if (isBidCollateralBacked(_bidId)) {
            BidState bidState = tellerV2.getBidState(_bidId);

            require(
